Sign a message using FROST threshold signing.

Request:

{
  "message": "hex-encoded-bytes",
  "shares": [
    { "share_id": 1, "encrypted_share": "base64", "password": "..." },
    { "share_id": 2, "encrypted_share": "base64", "password": "..." }
  ]
}

Response:

{
  "signature": "65-byte-hex",
  "wallet_id": "uuid",
  "signed_at": "2026-09-18T12:00:00Z"
}

